      {
        "id": "spi-role-definition",
        "moduleId": "overview",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材定义：SPI 是什么",
        "markdown": "SPI（Serial Peripheral Interface）是一种**同步串行**接口和协议：教材给出的传输速率可达 **20 Mbps**，用于微控制器与一个或多个外设之间的短距离通信，通常发生在设备内部。\n\nSPI 连接中始终有一个主设备（多数情况下是控制传输的微控制器 μC）和一个或多个从设备。所有设备共用三条信号线，此外每个从设备还各有一条独立的使能线。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-84c289b92b9ee9ffcf19c83c",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000292"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Hello World!",
                "SPI"
              ],
              "lineStart": 4974,
              "lineEnd": 5014,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0002/images/cc0e4ba1bb0a536ed7851e5d74b2bfa3167ec07347f83e69ffa09a46bea89204.jpg",
                "parts/part-0002/images/82aafbd329464cdcf12f10ef9f7c4691c90f0872a4aa7ad672c3c7312926917c.jpg",
